<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | DollarAngle" description="Starter privacy policy for DollarAngle before analytics, newsletter and advertising providers are connected." noindex={true}>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span><h1>Clear, minimal privacy practices.</h1><p>This pre-launch privacy page will be finalized after the production analytics, newsletter, hosting and advertising providers are selected.</p></div></section>
<section class="section" style="padding-top:10px"><div class="container prose-wrap"><article class="prose"><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>If you subscribe, contact us or submit information through a form, we may receive information such as your email address, name and the content of your message.</p><h2>Analytics and device information</h2><p>When analytics are enabled, we may receive information such as browser type, device type, approximate location, referring page and pages viewed. The exact data collected depends on the tools we deploy.</p><h2>Cookies and advertising</h2><p>If DollarAngle later uses advertising, analytics or affiliate tools that rely on cookies or similar technologies, this policy and any required consent controls will be updated before launch in applicable jurisdictions.</p><h2>Third parties</h2><p>Service providers may process information on our behalf for hosting, analytics, email delivery, security or advertising. Those providers will be disclosed here once the production stack is finalized.</p><blockquote><strong>Pre-launch note:</strong> This page is intentionally not final legal copy and is marked noindex until the stack and domain are finalized.</blockquote></article><aside class="sidebar"><h3>DollarAngle</h3><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a><a href="/disclaimer">Financial Disclaimer</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
